      "source": "`passwordContentDescription` (Passcode.CustomRegex.PasswordContentDescription): Contains a dictionary of keys for supported OS language IDs (for example, “en-US”), and whose values represent a localized description of the policy enforced by the regular expression. Use the special `default` key can for languages that aren’t contained in the dictionary.",
